<title>SINGAPORE: Eltech incorporates subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Eltech incorporates subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eltech Electronics Ltd said on Friday it has incorporated wholly-owned subsidiary Eltech Land Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Eltech Land, an investment holding company, has an authorised capital of Singapore $10 million and is involved in estate development, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
